WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
The two children have a good relationship

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,400
Marriage is also a matter of course

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,560
Why don't you set the date today?

4
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,360
OK, let's settle it

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,120
Grandpa, I'm still young

6
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,440
Eighteen, already an adult, not too young

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,840
Engagement early next month

8
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,720
Get the certificate and hold the wedding in three years

9
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,800
Two weeks is too hasty?

10
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:21,080
We will prepare immediately. Two weeks is enough to decide early.

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,120
It's a good way to put an end to that really huge ambition.

12
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:25,000
Let him come when you get engaged

13
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,560
Let him bless you in person

14
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,640
It also prevents outsiders from seeing the joke between the two families.

15
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,660
He must be there

16
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,340
Bless Tingfeng and Ling Yun

17
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:35,100
Wen Chen is studying at Zhongzhou University

18
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,300
Are you still dissatisfied?

19
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:39,700
He didn’t even take the college entrance examination. What kind of books is he studying? Don’t be fooled by him.

20
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:40,900
Xiaoyun also saw it

21
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,100
Xiaoyun, you said

22
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:46,060
Maybe he has some way to get in anyway.

23
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:47,180
He was all born to me

24
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:48,620
You can't live outside forever

25
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:50,020
Take him with you to the engagement party

26
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:51,660
Save yourself the trouble of making irresponsible remarks from outside.

27
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,460
You should contact him first and then talk about it.
